OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested in murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder after a man died in a
OL,8,FStaffordshire village.
OL,10,FPolice were called by the ambulance
OL,11,Fservice at 14:45 BST on Monday to
OL,12,Freports of a sudden death at a property
OL,13,Fon Coppice Lane in Cheslyn Hay.
OL,15,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,16,Fscene, Staffordshire Police said.
OL,18,FThe force said two men, aged 53 and 58,
OL,19,Fboth from the Cannock area, had been
OL,20,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,21,Fwere in custody.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
